adapted from the dxf crate 0.6.2 (https://github.com/ixmilia/dxf-rs, crates.io dxf 0.6.2, read
from the local cargo registry 2026-10-21; lane SMB-DXF-EPS-IMPORT remediation): the group-code
value-type table (src/expected_type.rs), the ASCII and binary code-pair readers
(src/code_pair_iter.rs), the string un-escaping (src/code_pair_value.rs), the section, table,
block and entity reading order and the POLYLINE/VERTEX and INSERT/ATTRIB gathering
(src/drawing.rs, src/block.rs, src/entity.rs, src/entity_iter.rs), and the field codes and
default values of the entity, LAYER and header records it reads (spec/EntitiesSpec.xml,
spec/TableSpec.xml, spec/HeaderVariablesSpec.xml). The dxf crate itself is not a dependency.
